#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:1
msgid "2.3 Safety Protection Mechanisms"
msgstr "2.3 安全保护机制"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:4
msgid "2.3.1 Hard Emergency Stop"
msgstr "2.3.1 硬急停"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:7
msgid "Trigger Method: Press the emergency stop button on the robot body"
msgstr "触发方式：按下机身急停按钮"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:8
msgid ""
"Effect: The robot is slowly lowered to the ground, and the red indicator "
"light illuminates"
msgstr "效果：机器狗缓慢着地，红灯亮起"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:9
msgid "Indicator Light Status"
msgstr "指示灯状态"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:10
msgid "When pressed: Red light on"
msgstr "按下时：红灯亮"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:11
msgid "After release: Green light on"
msgstr "松开后：绿灯亮"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:12
msgid ""
"Recovery: Once the system status is reset, the system automatically "
"recovers (provided no other faults exist)"
msgstr "恢复：旋开急停按钮后，系统自动恢复(若无其他故障)"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:14
msgid "2.3.2 Soft Emergency Stop"
msgstr "2.3.2 软急停"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:17
msgid "Trigger Method: Via the remote controller or via the SDK interface"
msgstr "触发方式：通过遥控器触发或者通过sdk接口触发"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:18
msgid ""
"Effect: The robot stops immediately and no longer responds to any control"
" commands"
msgstr "效果：机器人立即停车，不再响应任何控制指令"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:19
msgid ""
"Recovery: Normal operation can resume after releasing the soft emergency "
"stop"
msgstr "恢复：接触软急停后可恢复正常操作"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:21
msgid ""
"**Starting from SDK version V0.0.6, the system allows users to switch "
"between remote controller mode and SDK mode. Before triggering the soft "
"emergency stop via the remote controller during SDK control, you must "
"open the App and enable control authority. Once acquired, you can trigger"
" a soft emergency stop at any time using the red emergency stop button at"
" the upper right of the remote controller. After the soft emergency stop "
"is triggered, the robot displays a red light, maintains its current "
"posture, and does not respond to any control commands. Press the "
"emergency stop button on the remote controller again to resume "
"operation.**"
msgstr "**从V0.0.6版本sdk起，支持遥控器和sdk控制权切换功能，若要实现在sdk控制阶段通过遥控器触发设备软急停，必须得在sdk获取控制权后，点开app，然后便可以随时使用遥控器右上方红色急停按钮触发软急停，触发软急停后，机器狗显示红灯，保持当前姿态，不再响应任何控制指令**"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:23
msgid "2.3.3 Internal Exception Protection (Automatic Trigger)"
msgstr "2.3.3 内部异常保护(自动触发)"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:26
msgid ""
"The following conditions will trigger the internal protection mechanism, "
"causing the robot to automatically stop and lower itself to the ground "
"slowly:"
msgstr "以下情况将触发内部保护机制，机器人自动停车并缓慢着地"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:27
msgid ""
"Remote control signal disconnection (including network congestion); "
"reconnection via the APP will restore operation"
msgstr "遥控信号断连(含网络阻塞)，重新连接APP即可恢复"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:28
msgid "Battery present but charge level < 10%"
msgstr "电池在位但电量<10%"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:29
msgid "Joint fault"
msgstr "关节故障"

#: ../../source/2.3Safety_Protection_Mechanisms.md:30
msgid "IMU communication interruption"
msgstr "IMU(惯性测量单元)通信中断"

